{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"wuhuan-p-9852bfc06904ae","name":"驳位居","evidence":["wuhuan-q-32e0ff2168756fe1f0a0"],"facts":[{"id":"wuhuan-f-2fea51cff358d837ac39","text":"拔奇子，留高句丽为古雏加；不与夫余位居合并。","evidence":["wuhuan-q-32e0ff2168756fe1f0a0"]}],"mentions":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wuhuan-q-32e0ff2168756fe1f0a0","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-ffc4a2c8b72ed79c4569","layer":"original","quote":"建安中，公孙康出军击之，破其国，焚烧邑落。拔奇怨为兄而不得立，与涓奴加各将下户三万余口〖38〗，诣康降，还住沸流水。降胡亦叛伊夷模；伊夷模更作新国，今日所在是也。拔奇遂往辽东；有子留句丽国，今古雏加驳位居是也。其后复击玄菟，玄菟与辽东合击，大破之。","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":191,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":124,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
